      "description": {
        "en": "Container bundle for composable DSH UI sub-plugins: toggle, compose and remove them like plugins. The bundled Pinned/Unread sub-plugin expands a floating list inside the left column with pinned sessions first and background-finished unread sessions after them.",
        "zh": "可组合 DSH 界面子插件的容器：像插件一样开关、组合、卸载。内置「置顶/未读」子插件——点侧栏入口就在左侧栏就地展开浮层，置顶会话在前、后台跑完未读的在后，点一下即切换。"
      },
