    {
      "name": "leo-status",
      "title": {
        "en": "Leo Status",
        "zh": "Leo 状态"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "A TODO board aggregated from Obsidian notes and DSH sessions, with automatic vault discovery (checkbox/#todo/frontmatter rules plus incremental cache). Session todos never auto-enter the board: they are filtered into Yuan suggestions and only appear after you accept them, with subagent sessions skipped. Yuan is a built-in steward with a rich Markdown chat, memory, reminders and categorized red-dot signals. Local Markdown todos can be checked/unchecked, cancelled/restored and deleted inline; this machine can be the hub and other devices join with a password.",
        "zh": "把 Obsidian 笔记与 DSH 会话里的 TODO 汇总成一个看板：自动发现 Obsidian 库（复选框 / #todo / frontmatter 规则 + 增量缓存）。会话 todo 不再自动进看板——只精筛成阿源建议，你在阿源里点接受后才出现，子代理会话默认跳过。阿源有接近 DSH 的 Markdown 对话、记忆、提醒与分类红点信号。本地 Markdown todo 可直接勾选/取消勾选、作废/启用/删除。本机可作中心，其他设备用密码加入。"
      },
      "icon": "leo-status-icon.svg",
      "author": "Leo / tula-liuxin",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/tula-liuxin/leo-status#readme",
